[length: 00:38.60]
[ti: Daisy Bell (Bicycle Built for Two)]
[00:00.00] Daisy Bell (Bicycle Built for Two)
[00:04.00] Daisy, Daisy, give me your answer, do!
[00:12.30] I'm half crazy, all for the love of you!
[00:20.30] It won't be a stylish marriage,
[00:24.20] I can't afford a carriage,
[00:28.50] But you'll look sweet upon the seat
[00:32.10] Of a bicycle built for two!
